ENT (default 20 percent) reserve of the account's total RC capacity, otherwise price Hive RC at zero and report the witness values in the component. Deleted hiveToSwapHiveUnits, HIVEPEGGED_DEPOSIT_FEE_BPS, HIVEPEGGED_MINIMUM_FEE_HIVE, RC_COST_TOLERANCE_PERCENT, RC_RESERVE_SAFETY_MULTIPLE, and their tests. RESOURCE_COMPONENT_NAMES unchanged (still Hive RC, signer, runner/paymaster). Updated stale BEED-fee comments in scripts/automatic-arbitrage-cycle.mjs and src/opportunity-feed.mjs, and rewrote the README's cost-model description. Also made test/automaticArbitrageCycle.test.mts's cloud-signer test hermetic (it previously called the real default pricer unmocked, which -- once RC pricing legitimately clears the net floor -- reaches the live cold-red-gate signer over real SSH; observed this during the pre-publish test run). resourceCostModel.mjs is not re-exported through src/index.mts or any package.json export/bin surface, so the change is additive/internal-only from the published package's public surface.\""]]],["pair",["pair",["mark","\"tarballDiffClassification\""],["pair",["mark","\"rmn.json.string\""],["mark","\"additive\""]]],["pair",["pair",["mark","\"toVersion\""],["pair",["mark","\"rmn.json.string\""],["mark","\"0.4.2\""]]],["star"]]]]]]]]]]]],"t":"2026-09-05T04:06:20.813Z"}
