mber\""],["mark","303"]]],["star"]]]]]],["pair",["pair",["mark","\"fromVersion\""],["pair",["mark","\"rmn.json.string\""],["mark","\"0.4.5\""]]],["pair",["pair",["mark","\"package\""],["pair",["mark","\"rmn.json.string\""],["mark","\"@red-cup-engineering/aagaard\""]]],["pair",["pair",["mark","\"summary\""],["pair",["mark","\"rmn.json.string\""],["mark","\"Real incident fix: michael561 broadcast a bundled swapTokens+sell custom_json at 05:15:18Z (txid a6308f23ba5026f1e670e61cea257eaf62524322) whose sell leg failed on-chain (\\\"not enough tokens for multiTransaction fee\\\") because Hive-Engine resourcemanager charges a real 0.001 BEED fee for bundling 2+ actions past numberOfFreeTx=1 -- a real fee the earlier BEED-bid-book check was wrongly approximating. Split the round trip into two standalone single-action custom_json legs (swap, then sell), each independently gated by its own fresh route-stale check (pool reserves for the swap; order-book depth for the sell) and, for the sell leg, a re-derived worst-case-profit-vs-overhead gate using the paired leg cost. Kept the legacy 2-action bundle path defensively, now gated by a live resourcemanager.params BEED-floor read (no invented substitute). Every remoteSource refusal now returns {status:\\\"refused\\\",datum,reason} and exits 0 instead of throwing -- a refusal is not a crash. Added a standalone reconciliation-sell target/shape for closing out a residue position with no paired leg. hiveEngineConfirmation.mjs gained assessSwapLegEffect/assessSellLegEffect for per-leg on-chain confirmation. automatic-arbitrage-cycle.mjs orchestrates swap-then-confirm-then-sell-then-confirm for the cold-red-gate lane; the local-keyFile fallback lane is unchanged (still the legacy bundle via hive-broadcast.mjs).\""]]],["pair",["pair",["mark","\"tarballDiffClassification\""],["pair",["mark","\"rmn.json.string\""],["mark","\"breaking-internal-only\""]]],["pair",["pair",["mark","\"tarballDiffNote\""],["pair",["mark","\"rmn.json.string\""],["mark","\"package.json exports map unchanged (additive at the public surface); scripts/cold-red-gate-arbitrage-broadcast.mjs renamed/removed validateRemoteArbitrageRequest and broadcastArbitrageViaColdRedGate in favor of per-leg validateSwapLegRequest/validateSellLegRequest/validateBundledRoundTripRequest and broadcastSwapLegViaColdRedGate/broadcastSellLegViaColdRedGate/broadcastBundledRoundTripViaColdRedGate -- the only consumer (scripts/automatic-arbitrage-cycle.mjs) is updated in this same diff, and grep across the whole package plus a registry-wide check found no other consumer.\""]]],["pair",["pair",["mark","\"toVersion\""],["pair",["mark","\"rmn.json.string\""],["mark","\"0.4.6\""]]],["star"]]]]]]]]]]]]]],"t":"2026-09-05T05:51:22.904Z"}
